Prices json output: prices for unused commodities produce an empty listing.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight prices --format json

========== API ==========

prices()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity ZEBRA
  format 1000 ZEBRA
commodity ALPHA
  format 1000 ALPHA
commodity Long_Fund_Name
  format 1000 Long_Fund_Name
commodity UNUSED
  format 1000 UNUSED
account Assets:Funds
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
account Income:Gains
P 2024-01-01 UNUSED 100 SEK

2024-01-01 Cash only
  Assets:Cash  100 SEK
  Equity:Opening  -100 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[]
